#
# ✒ Description:
#     Pins every text file to LF line endings in the repository and the
#     working tree, whatever core.autocrlf says on the machine, so files
#     read the same on Windows, macOS and Linux. Fonts are marked binary.
#
# ✒ Other Important Information:
#     - Dependencies: none
#     - Compatible platforms: Git on Windows, macOS, Linux
# ==============================================================================

* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
